      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Barinov has found out that the rival restaurant is trying to recruit his cooks. After an angry phone call with Elena, he storms into the kitchen holding a résumé and demands to know whose it is. Here's the Russian first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
